# Prop benchmark (development tool, not a test): see docs/DEV.md "Benchmark".
bottega make studio
copy assets/models/crate.glb studio/models/crate.glb
copy rock.glb studio/models/rock.glb
rescan
block -20000 -20000 -64 20000 20000 0
key Esc
bench props 500 models/crate
bench clear
bench props 2000 models/crate
bench clear
bench props 5000 models/crate
bench clear
bench props 300 models/rock 250
bench clear
bench props 1000 models/rock 250
quit
